{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / Problem\n`CONTRIBUTING.md:689-697` says dependency updates use security alerts only, not version-bump PRs; says `.github/dependabot.yml` configures GitHub-Actions monthly version-update PRs; and says there is intentionally no `pip` ecosystem entry because core dependencies are unpinned. `docs/releasing.md:590-595` repeats the stale one-ecosystem guidance by saying `.github/dependabot.yml` runs GitHub-Actions version updates monthly and calls that the pip/pydantic GitHub-native shape.\n\nThe current source of truth is `.github/dependabot.yml`. Its header at `.github/dependabot.yml:1-8` says Dependabot opens advisory PRs for monthly GitHub Actions and weekly uv updates, maintainers reproduce accepted bumps through Gerrit, the uv entry updates the committed `uv.lock`, and security alerts remain enabled independently of version-update PRs. The active entries configure `github-actions` on a monthly cadence with group `github-actions` at `.github/dependabot.yml:15-24`, and `uv` on a weekly cadence with group `uv-lock` at `.github/dependabot.yml:27-39`. Major `mcp` version updates are ignored at `.github/dependabot.yml:35-37` while patch and security updates remain enabled per `.github/dependabot.yml:10-12`.\n\n## Approach\nUpdate `CONTRIBUTING.md` and `docs/releasing.md` to use `.github/dependabot.yml` as the source of truth. The prose should state the two ecosystems, the two cadences, the lock-backed uv behavior, the advisory PR workflow through Gerrit, and the `mcp` major-version ignore rule without copying every Dependabot key.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `CONTRIBUTING.md` removes the claim at lines 689-690 that dependency updates use security alerts only and replaces it with a statement that Dependabot opens advisory version-update PRs for monthly GitHub Actions and weekly uv updates while security alerts remain enabled independently.\n- [ ] `CONTRIBUTING.md` replaces the Actions-only claim at line 691 with the current `.github/dependabot.yml:15-39` configuration: `github-actions` runs monthly in group `github-actions`, and `uv` runs weekly in group `uv-lock`.\n- [ ] `CONTRIBUTING.md` replaces the no-`pip` rationale at lines 695-697 with the current lock-backed uv rationale from `.github/dependabot.yml:5-8`: uv updates the committed `uv.lock`, published metadata keeps unpinned minimums, and a pip entry would change nothing.\n- [ ] `CONTRIBUTING.md` documents the `mcp` major-version ignore from `.github/dependabot.yml:35-37` while stating that patch updates and security updates remain enabled.\n- [ ] `docs/releasing.md` replaces the one-ecosystem guidance at lines 590-595 with the same monthly GitHub Actions, weekly uv, committed-`uv.lock`, Gerrit-advisory workflow, and `mcp` major-ignore statements used in `CONTRIBUTING.md`.\n- [ ] `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make verify` exits 0 after the documentation edits.\n\n## Testing\nRun `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make verify` from the repository checkout and land only if it exits 0."}},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1789871452927977529,"uuid":"94eb83c1-514d-4fa3-b5ad-3fed64b30b90"}